# Opensource UI — Site Chrome (Marketing + Docs)

Apply when editing `app/(marketing)/`, `app/(docs)/`, or shared `app/_shared/` UI. This is the **opensourceui.in** brand surface — not the copy-paste `components/` library.

Design authority: `skills/opensource-ui/references/design.md`.

## Typography pairing ("Two-Voice Rule")

| Voice | Font | Where |
| ----- | ---- | ----- |
| **Display** | Instrument Serif (`font-serif`) | Marketing H1, brand headlines, docs section titles, footer brand line |
| **UI / body** | Geist (`font-sans`, `tracking-tight`) | Buttons, nav, paragraphs, form labels, docs sidebar |
| **Mono** | Geist Mono (`font-mono`, ~10px) | Keyboard hints, code chrome, platform tags |

```tsx
// ✅ Marketing headline
<h1 className="font-serif text-3xl text-neutral-900">...</h1>

// ✅ Docs / product UI
<p className="text-base tracking-tight text-neutral-700">...</p>
```

Marketing body columns: cap near **`max-w-xl`** (~65ch).

## Color and elevation

- **Stage stays neutral** — white/near-white backgrounds, ink text, `border-neutral-100`/`200` structure
- **Accents** (cyan underlines, rose callout dots on the design-card demo): craft moments only, not site chrome
- **Flat by default** — no stacked card shadows; depth from borders and tonal fills
- **CTA lift** (`shadow-xl shadow-neutral-300/50`): primary marketing CTA only (e.g. "Browse Components")
- **Docs nav:** idle `text-neutral-500`, active/hover `text-neutral-900`; active TOC uses a **2px ink left bar**

## Layout patterns

- **Marketing (`/`):** centered column, `px-3 md:px-4`, component demos as hero content
- **Docs (`/components`):** three-column on large screens — sidebar nav, main content, on-page TOC
- **Responsive:** base + `md:` only — never `sm:`

## Imports in app code

App shell **may** import from `@/components/`, `@/lib/`, `@/icons/`, `next/link`, `next/image` — unlike copy-paste components, the app is not meant to be copied as a single file.

Use existing shared pieces: `createPageMetadata` from `@/lib/seo`, `siteConfig` from `@/lib/site`, `BOX_PATTERN` from `@/lib/shared`, docs shell components under `app/(docs)/components/_components/`.

## Motion

- Marketing micro-interactions: `--ease-smooth` (`cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)`) via `ease-smooth` or `duration-300`/`duration-500`
- Always respect **`prefers-reduced-motion`**
- No motion theater — clarity over wow

## Do not

- Purple/violet/indigo accents, gradients, glow, glassmorphism
- Instrument Serif on dense controls (inputs, button rows, nav lists)
- Inter or other off-brand fonts
- `sm:` breakpoints
- Raw `<a href>` — use `Link` from `next/link`
